include LICENSE.md NOTICE README.md CHANGELOG.md ROADMAP.md V2_RELEASE.txt
include SECURITY.md CONTRIBUTING.md SUPPORT.md GOVERNANCE.md AUTHORS.md MAINTAINERS.md
include CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md CITATION.cff PUBLISHING.md AGENTS.md
include LICENSES/*.md
recursive-include docs *.md
recursive-include security *.md
